    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ ælc ðæra landa ðe ænige friðige ðæra ðe Englaland hergie, beo hit utlah wið us ⁊ wið ealne here.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And any region which affords protection to any of those who harry England shall be treated as an enemy [country] by us and all the aforesaid fleet.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et omnis terra, quę aliquem eorum manuteneat, qui Angliam inquietant, sit exlex apud nos et omnem exercitum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
